        10["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Registry</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 3]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Registers a gate BEFORE its<br />run, with pass_condition,<br />falsifies_condition and<br />pre_registration_path.<br />Refuses a verdict with no<br />registered gate.</div>"]
        style 10 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        11["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Verdict</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 3]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Authors<br />PASS|PARTIAL|FAIL|WITHHELD|PENDING<br />only. Refuses a percent score<br />and a PARTIAL that does not<br />name its holding sub-claim.</div>"]
        style 11 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        12["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Anchor</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 3]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Holds the expected head and<br />length OUTSIDE the chain. A<br />hash chain cannot detect<br />truncation from its own tail;<br />a prefix of a valid chain is<br />a valid chain.</div>"]
        style 12 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        13["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Store</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 4]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Durable append-only<br />persistence. Until it exists<br />the Control Plane cannot<br />record its own mutations and<br />nothing holds an anchor<br />across a restart.</div>"]
        style 13 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        14["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Run</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 4]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Immutable run identity: code<br />identity, env identity,<br />inputs, params, seeds,<br />start/end in unix_ns and UTC,<br />exit code, output hashes.</div>"]
        style 14 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        15["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Pair</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 4]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Enforces exactly one<br />differing variable between<br />arms. Two differences mark<br />the run VOID and unclaimable.</div>"]
        style 15 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        16["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Drift</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 2]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Like-for-like comparison<br />only. Refuses a cross-type<br />comparison AT CONSTRUCTION,<br />so the Phase 1 defect cannot<br />recur.</div>"]
        style 16 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        17["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Witness</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 5]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>An anchor the ledger's writer<br />cannot reach. A local anchor<br />cannot outrank a local<br />writer: a tamperer who owns<br />the store directory can<br />truncate the ledger and<br />rewrite its anchor to match.</div>"]
        style 17 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        18["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Room + Key</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 6]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>green to clean to sterile,<br />two keys per airlock. A<br />failed condition names the<br />missing receipt. No override<br />path.</div>"]
        style 18 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        19["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Scene</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 7]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Pure function of state. Every<br />node carries truth_class,<br />receipt_ref, evidence_class,<br />captured_at. A node missing<br />them renders as fog.</div>"]
        style 19 fill:#fdf1ee,stroke:#b4442f,color:#16181d
        7["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Command</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 2]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>The ONLY writer. Records<br />actor, role, utc, unix_ns,<br />prior, transition,<br />authorization, evidence,<br />resulting, hash. Inherits the<br />Door's law: a read never<br />actuates.</div>"]
        style 7 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        8["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Ledger</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 2]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Append-only, hash-chained via<br />prev_hash. verify/1 walks the<br />chain; tampering any past<br />entry fails it. History is<br />extended, never edited.</div>"]
        style 8 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
        9["<div style='font-weight: bold'>GateRow</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Elixir, phase 2]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Builds and validates a row<br />against gate_row.schema.json<br />in hand-written Elixir with<br />stdlib JSON. supersedes<br />chains a revision without<br />mutating what it supersedes.</div>"]
        style 9 fill:#e8f4ef,stroke:#0f6e56,color:#16181d
      end

